      "releaseNotes": "For Apple Creator Studio Subscribers:\n\nIntelligent Assistant (Beta)*\n• Build your story, add animations, and refine your slides with an assistant that understands your presentation\n• Get guidance on where to start, learn how to use advanced features, or try a suggestion to see what’s possible\n• Generate slides, presenter notes, images, and shapes using natural language\n• Search for up-to-date information on a topic and incorporate it into your slides\n\nNew Premium Content\n• Elevate your presentation with a new collection of professionally-designed themes\n• Browse the Content Hub to find curated videos that add motion and depth to your presentation\n\nFor Everyone:\n• Import and export presentations in Keynote’s new Interchange Format (.keyx), an open file format that makes it easier to work with content outside of the app (beta)\n• Additional bug fixes and performance improvements\n\n* US English only. Requires an Apple Intelligence-capable device with iOS 27, iPadOS 27, or later.",
